          "description": "Welcome to the YofA podcast for curious minds and young artists. Each episode takes you on a fascinating journey through the history of art as we know it today. Play along with the quiz, join the art-along activity... Tune in for a bit of learning, and - as we say in Ireland - a lot of craic!",
